Package: camera-box-pipewire-shim
Version: 1.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: camera-box provisioning <noreply@newlevel.media>
Provides: gstreamer1.0-pipewire
Description: stands in for gstreamer1.0-pipewire on a strih box without PipeWire (issue 1440)
 RustDesk 1.4.9 depends on gstreamer1.0-pipewire. The strih role runs no
 sound server (issue 1440), so setup-strih step 12 purges PipeWire and pins
 it out; this empty package carries the dependency, so RustDesk stays
 installed. Built on the box by setup-strih (dpkg-deb), never downloaded.
